<title>USA: Ergobilt names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Ergobilt names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ergobilt Inc said Monday it has named William Glenn Jr as its new senior vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Glenn succeeds Michael Sullivan, who resigned to accept a similar position with another company that Ergobilt did not name.</p>
<p>Glenn has been serving as a director of Ergobilt since the company's initial public offering in February 1997.</p>
<p>Prior to joining the management of Ergobilt, he was a managing officer of a privately held aviation services company.</p>
<p>Ergobilt develops, manufactures and markets ergonomic office products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
